{"id":"a885beae46be5447","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-third-edition-distinct-three-cnf.md","title":"第三版恰含三个互异文字的 3-CNF","display":"df-third-edition-distinct-three-cnf — 第三版恰含三个互异文字的 3-CNF","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-third-edition-distinct-three-cnf","aliases":["73-df-third-edition-distinct-three-cnf"],"display":"df-third-edition-distinct-three-cnf — 第三版恰含三个互异文字的 3-CNF","depends_on":["[[73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.3.4, print pp. 456–458; PDF pp. 478–480","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-third-edition-distinct-three-cnf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-third-edition-distinct-three-cnf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-third-edition-distinct-three-cnf — 第三版恰含三个互异文字的 3-CNF"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"88dea30e48fadc7f\" href=\"?note=88dea30e48fadc7f\" title=\"73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas\">73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.3.4, print pp. 456–458; PDF pp. 478–480"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=(\\operatorname{bcode},\\operatorname{bdecode})\">\\(\\mathcal B=(\\operatorname{bcode},\\operatorname{bdecode})\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Lit},\\operatorname{Conj},\\operatorname{Disj}\">\\(\\mathsf{Lit},\\operatorname{Conj},\\operatorname{Disj}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"88dea30e48fadc7f\" href=\"?note=88dea30e48fadc7f\" title=\"73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas\">73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Clause}_{3,\\ne}\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathsf{Lit}^3:\\forall i,j\\in\\{0,1,2\\}\\;(i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow C(i)\\ne C(j))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Clause}_{3,\\ne}\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathsf{Lit}^3:\\forall i,j\\in\\{0,1,2\\}\\;(i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow C(i)\\ne C(j))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ThreeCNF}_{\\ne}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{Conj}(\\langle\\operatorname{Disj}(\\mathbf C(i)):0\\le i&lt;|\\mathbf C|\\rangle):\n\\mathbf C\\in(\\mathsf{Clause}_{3,\\ne})^{&lt;\\omega}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ThreeCNF}_{\\ne}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{Conj}(\\langle\\operatorname{Disj}(\\mathbf C(i)):0\\le i&lt;|\\mathbf C|\\rangle):\n\\mathbf C\\in(\\mathsf{Clause}_{3,\\ne})^{&lt;\\omega}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ThreeSAT}^{\\ne}_{\\mathcal B}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{ThreeCNF}_{\\ne}\\land\n\\exists\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbf2\\;⟦\\varphi⟧_\\nu=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ThreeSAT}^{\\ne}_{\\mathcal B}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{ThreeCNF}_{\\ne}\\land\n\\exists\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbf2\\;⟦\\varphi⟧_\\nu=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第三版 §10.3.4 指三个互异文字。旧目录采用“至多三个文字”的便利版本，不能仅靠重复同一个文字填充成第三版版本；必须用新变量构造等可满足的子句组。互异文字并不自动要求底层变量两两不同，p 与 ¬p 是不同文字。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas","status":"resolved","id":"88dea30e48fadc7f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas","status":"resolved","id":"88dea30e48fadc7f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)$，$\\mathcal B=(\\operatorname{bcode},\\operatorname{bdecode})$。$\\mathsf{Lit},\\operatorname{Conj},\\operatorname{Disj}$ 使用 [[73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B=(\\operatorname{bcode},\\operatorname{bdecode})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Lit},\\operatorname{Conj},\\operatorname{Disj}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Clause}_{3,\\ne}\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathsf{Lit}^3:\\forall i,j\\in\\{0,1,2\\}\\;(i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow C(i)\\ne C(j))\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ThreeCNF}_{\\ne}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{Conj}(\\langle\\operatorname{Disj}(\\mathbf C(i)):0\\le i<|\\mathbf C|\\rangle):\n\\mathbf C\\in(\\mathsf{Clause}_{3,\\ne})^{<\\omega}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ThreeSAT}^{\\ne}_{\\mathcal B}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{ThreeCNF}_{\\ne}\\land\n\\exists\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbf2\\;⟦\\varphi⟧_\\nu=1\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1827,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-265","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-third-edition-distinct-three-cnf|第三版恰含三个互异文字的 3-CNF]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"842c1db14c45597e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["88dea30e48fadc7f"]}